  "_note": "Live county-level feeds for the Senate race. Every feed is re-checked every refresh_seconds; unchanged files cost almost nothing (the bot asks 'changed since last time?'). The workbook is rebuilt at most every workbook_seconds. 'test' overrides point at the Nov 2024 files for /countytest. post_alerts posts key-county and projection changes to the board channel. States not listed here are typed in by hand. Sites marked bot_check sit behind Cloudflare: if they answer the bot with a challenge page, the bot stops trying for 15 minutes and you use the County Watch grab button instead (it saves countywatch-XX.json to Downloads, which the bot loads). /countyfeed sets a Clarity election link (SC, IA) if the site doesn't list the election by date.",
